---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { localizedPath, companyName, type Locale } from '../../data/i18n';
import { site } from '../../data/site';
interface Props {
  locale: Locale;
}
const { locale } = Astro.props;
const c = (en: string, zh: string) => (locale === 'en' ? en : zh);
---

<Layout
  locale={locale}
  title={c(
    'TurnMath Privacy Policy | Hailink Labs',
    'TurnMath 隐私政策 | Hailink Labs',
  )}
  description={c(
    'How TurnMath handles local play data, Apple purchases and parent support.',
    'TurnMath 本地游戏数据、Apple 购买与家长支持隐私说明。',
  )}
>
  <section class="page-intro policy-intro">
    <a class="breadcrumb" href={localizedPath('/products/turnmath', locale)}>
      TurnMath /
    </a>
    <h1>{c('Privacy policy', '隐私政策')}</h1>
    <p class="intro-copy">
      {c('Effective September 28, 2026', '生效日期：2026 年 9 月 28 日')}
    </p>
  </section>
  <article class="policy prose">
    {locale === 'zh-CN' && (
      <p>
        本中文版本为方便阅读提供，如有差异以
        <a href="/products/turnmath/privacy">英文版本</a>为准。
      </p>
    )}
    <h2>{c('Who we are', '我们是谁')}</h2>
    <p>
      TurnMath{' '}
      {c(
        'is developed by Hailink Labs, the brand of ',
        '由 Hailink Labs 开发，品牌所属主体为',
      )}
      {companyName(locale)}.{' '}
      {c(
        'This policy covers the app and contact with us.',
        '本政策适用于 App 及你与我们的联系。',
      )}
    </p>
    <h2>{c('Children and local play data', '儿童与本地游戏数据')}</h2>
    <p>
      {c(
        'TurnMath is designed for children ages 6–8 playing with a parent. We do not collect personal information through the app. There is no account, child name, birthday, profile, photo, chat or user-generated content. Player labels are temporary and do not identify a child.',
        'TurnMath 面向与家长一起游戏的 6–8 岁儿童。我们不通过 App 收集个人信息。App 没有账号、儿童姓名、生日、档案、照片、聊天或用户生成内容。玩家标签是临时称呼，不标识儿童。',
      )}
    </p>
    <p>
      {c(
        'The app stores preferences and unnamed session records on the device: session identifiers, dates, mode, challenge counts, self-marked results and completion status. These records are not sent to Hailink Labs. Self-marked counts are not an educational assessment.',
        'App 在设备本地保存偏好与无姓名的会话记录：会话标识、日期、模式、挑战次数、自行标记结果和完成状态。这些记录不会发送给 Hailink Labs。自行标记的统计不是教育测评。',
      )}
    </p>
    <h2>{c('Permissions, speech and tracking', '权限、朗读与跟踪')}</h2>
    <p>
      {c(
        'No microphone, camera, location, contacts or photo-library permission is requested. English speech uses Apple’s on-device speech synthesizer; the app does not listen, record or upload voices. There are no ads, analytics, third-party SDKs or cross-app tracking.',
        'App 不请求麦克风、相机、位置、通讯录或相册权限。英语朗读使用 Apple 设备端语音合成；App 不聆听、录制或上传声音。没有广告、分析、第三方 SDK 或跨应用跟踪。',
      )}
    </p>
    <h2>{c('Apple purchases and services', 'Apple 购买与服务')}</h2>
    <p>
      {c(
        'Purchases and Restore Purchases are in Parent Area behind a randomized parental gate. Apple processes the optional non-consumable Lifetime Unlock through StoreKit. TurnMath checks verified Apple transactions to determine access, including eligible Family Sharing. We do not receive payment card details or run a receipt server. Free Starter is not a timed trial or subscription.',
        '购买与 Restore Purchases 位于随机家长验证保护的 Parent Area。Apple 通过 StoreKit 处理可选的非消耗型 Lifetime Unlock。TurnMath 检查已验证的 Apple 交易来确定权益，包括符合条件的家庭共享。我们不接收支付卡信息，也不运营收据服务器。Free Starter 不是计时试用或订阅。',
      )}
    </p>
    <p>
      {c(
        'Core play is offline. Apple may process purchase, account and diagnostic information under its own policies and your device settings.',
        '核心玩法离线运行。Apple 可能按其自身政策及你的设备设置处理购买、账号和诊断信息。',
      )}{' '}
      <a href="https://www.apple.com/legal/privacy/">
        {c('Apple privacy policy', 'Apple 隐私政策')}
      </a>
    </p>
    <h2>{c('Storage, retention and deletion', '存储、保存与删除')}</h2>
    <p>
      {c(
        'There is no app backend, CloudKit sync, export or in-app backup feature. Local play data remains until the app is removed. Removing the app deletes its local data; operating-system backups are managed separately through Apple settings. We cannot recover device records. Lifetime access can be restored using the purchasing Apple Account; restoring purchases does not restore play records.',
        'App 没有后端、CloudKit 同步、导出或应用内备份功能。本地游戏数据保留至 App 被移除。移除 App 会删除本地数据；操作系统备份通过 Apple 设置单独管理。我们无法恢复设备记录。终身权益可通过购买时的 Apple 账号恢复；恢复购买不会恢复游戏记录。',
      )}
    </p>
    <h2>{c('Parent support correspondence', '家长支持邮件')}</h2>
    <p>
      {c(
        'Support is intended for parents and guardians. If you email us, we receive your email address, message and attachments to answer your request. Please do not send child names, birthdays, photos, voices, passwords or payment credentials. Purchases and external links in the app are behind the parental gate.',
        '支持面向家长与监护人。你发邮件时，我们会收到邮箱地址、消息及附件，用于回复请求。请勿发送儿童姓名、生日、照片、声音、密码或支付凭据。App 内购买与外链受家长验证保护。',
      )}
    </p>
    <p>
      {c(
        'Our company mailbox uses Tencent’s business email service. Support correspondence may be accessed by Hailink Labs in China. We do not sell it or use it for advertising. We retain it for no longer than 12 months after an issue closes, unless an ongoing issue or legal obligation requires longer. Contact us to request access, correction or deletion; we may verify the request through the relevant email address.',
        '公司邮箱使用腾讯企业邮箱服务，Hailink Labs 可能在中国访问支持邮件。我们不出售这些信息，也不将其用于广告。问题关闭后保存不超过 12 个月，持续问题或法律义务需要更长时间的除外。你可联系申请访问、更正或删除；我们可能通过相关邮箱验证请求。',
      )}
    </p>
    <h2>{c('Website visits', '网站访问')}</h2>
    <p>
      {c(
        'This website has no analytics, advertising trackers, contact forms or accounts. GitHub Pages hosts the site and processes technical request data such as IP addresses for delivery and security.',
        '本网站没有分析、广告跟踪、联系表单或账号。GitHub Pages 托管网站，为交付与安全处理 IP 地址等技术请求数据。',
      )}{' '}
      <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement">
        {c('GitHub privacy statement', 'GitHub 隐私声明')}
      </a>
    </p>
    <h2>{c('Changes and contact', '变更与联系')}</h2>
    <p>
      {c(
        'We update this page and effective date when data handling changes. Material changes will be explained here and, where appropriate, in the app.',
        '数据处理变化时，我们会更新本页及生效日期。重大变化将在此说明，并在适当情况下通过 App 告知。',
      )}
    </p>
    <p>
      Hailink Labs · {companyName(locale)}
      <br />
      <a href={`mailto:${site.email}?subject=TurnMath%20Privacy`}>
        {site.email}
      </a>
    </p>
    <p>
      <a href={localizedPath('/products/turnmath/support', locale)}>
        {c('Product support', '产品支持')}
      </a>
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>
